  "description": "Keeps fx3, master-comp, beat-repeat and master-filter off the stock pages whose ids they borrow (MIDI machine SRC and CC SELECT 246-253, 262-269; IMPULSE REP/NUM/SHP/HOLD 445/446/443/442; COL 402/406/412; NLEV/NDEC 431/432): those ids are the mods' only on the FX track (and the FX3 page); elsewhere the stock descriptors, objects and kit functions are restored. The context follows the active track of the UI page views (switch called by vparams from is-kit). SY FM4 scope: ids 254-261 (MIDI CC VALUE VAL1-VAL8) are FM4's page 2 knobs only while that page is on screen (draw prologue 0x4003A244, vparams); CC/NRPN lookups for them are suppressed meanwhile.",
